# L §5.10 example place sections, copied whole, with persons entered and readings added.  "declares one place of the
# kind per binding tuple ... A place keyed by things lives on the overlap of that span and its key things'
# lifespans: wcash[oki] lives from the day oki enters": owed[oki] lives from oki's 2026-03-01.  "A place's balance is
# zero at its lifespan's start"; "A place alive before S needs an anchor reading ... else the read is a hole naming
# the place (HOLE-ANCHOR)": owed[ewa] (alive from 2024-01-01, before S) has no balance before its opening on
# 2026-02-01 (L §8.1 `<place> has no balance before <d>`).  debts are `place one max 0`: "a leg that would take it
# above 0 is refused at that day (RUN-PLACE)": paying 150 into a debt of -100 is refused, and the balance with it
# from that point (E §4.2 step 5); a plan is in the day's first batch, checked together (L §5.10 point 1; L §8.4
# `<place> is <b> after the day's observations and plans of <d>`, writer 8).  `x in debts on d` ranges over the places alive on d (L §5.7).
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

kind persons

place owed[p in persons]: debts PLN lives 2024-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

input over_amt: money PLN
input pay_day: date

move overpay: transfers
  on pay_day
  leg cash from world to owed[ewa] amount over_amt

version people
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-01-01
  persons + [ewa] lives 1980-01-01..
  persons + [oki] lives 2026-03-01..
  opening[owed[ewa]] = -100.00 PLN at 2026-02-01 start
  over_amt = 150.00 PLN
  pay_day = 2026-05-04

ask life: lifespan(owed[oki]).from, lifespan(owed[ewa]).from
ask zero: bal(owed[oki], 2026-06-30)
ask anch: bal(owed[ewa], 2026-01-15)
ask open_: bal(owed[ewa], 2026-04-30)
ask over: bal(owed[ewa], 2026-05-04)
ask n: count(x in debts on 2026-02-15), count(x in debts on 2026-06-30)
=== expect
anch: ?"owed[ewa] has no balance before 2026-02-01" (owed[ewa])
  cut 2026-12-31
life: (2026-03-01, 2024-01-01)
  cut 2026-12-31
n: (1, 2)
  cut 2026-12-31
open_: -100.00 PLN
  cut 2026-12-31
over: refused: RUN-PLACE owed[ewa] is 50.00 PLN after the day's observations and plans of 2026-05-04
  cut 2026-12-31
zero: 0.00 PLN
  cut 2026-12-31
